{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_title", "source_sha256": "26e44d4f965bb6dd6ae9534a95d41e867f35dd76806c2d5eb390b5c3a38125ed", "ja": "「君と出会ってから」秋月律子", "zh": "“自从与你相遇后”秋月律子", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6af3961d8293fed2a9f8fb51e5409df3d718897260e90aed56614d399851cd77", "ja": "Destiny公演を前に、\n律子とプロデューサーが出会った頃からの\nことを振り返る一幕です。", "zh": "在Destiny公演前夕，\n律子与制作人一同回顾了\n自相遇以来的点点滴滴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4478ad23c7de20985a515709720da9163c4fb25eaf31559a3ecb6ad01a76308a", "ja": "（Destiny公演の準備で連日残業が続いている。\nさて、今日はそろそろ一区切りして……、おや？）", "zh": "（为了准备Destiny公演，已经连续加班好几天了。好了，今天也差不多该告一段落了……咦？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_1001_p", "source_sha256": "abfec3bf3d56488b29d29cc64d751f0241358fe15b0323cdde029dadd6c3f8d1", "ja": "律子？　まだ残ってたのか？", "zh": "律子？　你还没走吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "81c62e7bea779ee0c9199398d00e0fc25e189052277461fc88f130df8289f19b", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。お帰りなさい……\nえっ、もうこんな時間！？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。您回来了……\n诶，已经这么晚了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ab3e4f10ed803d565c64eebba991b3d286307c1f5d47fc88f17becfcc28a4142", "ja": "時計見てなかったのか……。大丈夫か？", "zh": "没看时间啊……。你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "b2663cd3826aaf88f4a9a6e0c8199a748a1f7aebfac9c600fb50a3e0f1180e55", "ja": "あはは。大丈夫っちゃ大丈夫です。\n終電には間に合うはず。", "zh": "啊哈哈。要说没事也确实没事。\n应该还能赶上末班车。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cbb2bff49a6193ee41518b47c3dd7eb4264194bdb1ab1a27bf0a8722d95b3996", "ja": "いや、その基準はちょっと。", "zh": "不，拿这个当标准可有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "69cada454feb736cef2e2b54088f6da24b66c32729d1c5410a41d3fc13df1d7b", "ja": "でも業者から見積書が上がってきたんですよ。\nそんなの、すぐチェックしたくなるじゃないですか。", "zh": "可是承包商已经把报价单送来了。\n这种东西，当然会让人想马上确认一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9bbeb5b8f23eb9496d8b945e41fa6a4b62be4a877a5880fbe337a0fade7d3df9", "ja": "やれやれ。明日でもいいのに……\n気になったら、すぐやらないと駄目なんだよな。", "zh": "哎呀呀。明明明天再看也行的……\n你还真是一旦在意起来，就非得马上处理不可啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "8eebabe028ee21e4e8d6336316a9772912e7f6fc495d074b9ad4ccf4adc1aa4a", "ja": "そのとおりです。性分なもので。\nまして今回は新しい機材もありますからね。", "zh": "正是如此。因为这是我的性格。\n更何况这次还有新的设备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0f0ab0cde5bf1f2c70fec2c17150c39a7613fcae0926a47508e7f35a8fba1c07", "ja": "帰りは車で送るよ。だからひと息入れよう。\nコンビニので悪いけど、ちょうど買って来てたんだ。", "zh": "回去时我开车送你吧。所以先歇一口气。\n虽然只是便利店买的有些过意不去，不过我正好买回来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_1010", "source_sha256": "0bf9906b1eb3af08a50b2cfff2c2a327dbf57c68a118fb8824990eec90bec294", "ja": "コーヒーを渡す", "zh": "递出咖啡", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2000_009rit", "source_sha256": "8b06076029e6eb98f268e087e4f5da00c497d775512fd17b47f9aa22557a3eca", "ja": "わあ、ありがとうございます。\nじゃあ、お言葉に甘えて……。", "zh": "哇，非常感谢。\n那我就不客气了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2001_009rit", "source_sha256": "95913abcbf62709ae3fc2bdc76d8b8a587e6edb3ae6a7b163b022f9223e20f42", "ja": "って、こんな風に{$P$}が私を\n甘やかすから、つい油断しちゃうのかな……？", "zh": "这么说来，都是因为{$P$}总是这样宠着我，我才会不由得放松警惕吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2002_p", "source_sha256": "9deb2236194ba12c038f40de19611a110bcabaafe70b27c590b51b3261b1f724", "ja": "甘やかされてるのはお互い様だよ。\nいま手伝ってもらってるのも、こっちだし。", "zh": "被宠着的是彼此啦。\n现在也是我在请你帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2003_009rit", "source_sha256": "0ca9036cd9d943b5789d1651d74c2015160295a2b9d6351ba8ecba06814b28cc", "ja": "そこは気にしないでください。\n好きでやってることですから。", "zh": "别在意这些了。因为这是我心甘情愿做的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2004_009rit", "source_sha256": "836df6c3d85a298e1ba29404d99819b5b50d838b46e8d9b98dd784efe5a4a1c3", "ja": "それに、今更じゃないですか？\n私たち、最初からずっとこんな感じでしたよね。", "zh": "而且，现在才在意这些，不觉得有点晚了吗？  \n我们从一开始就一直是这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2005_p", "source_sha256": "28c6127fe291852a7602ad586612655099b8b49074d7ff01e00bafcd2e3317ba", "ja": "……そうだな。律子自身のプロデュースも含めて、\nぜんぶ二人三脚というか……。", "zh": "……是啊。包括对律子本人的制作在内，我们一直都是并肩前行的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2006_p", "source_sha256": "f7c9a9aa9f1b490c4fdb68cddfa3603fb4b09c03379d5411b68dab65b991326b", "ja": "そういえば、初対面の時から心配されたっけ。\n本当にプロデューサーが務まるのか、って。", "zh": "说起来，从第一次见面时就被担心过来着。\n担心我到底能不能胜任制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2007_009rit", "source_sha256": "f480416f33efb8e019d3baff57ab572b73dc3b3416c102a13c7e7ebffdcf1b42", "ja": "うわあああ、それは忘れてくださいっ！\n……いや、その節はまことに失礼なことを……。", "zh": "呜哇啊啊啊，那件事请忘了吧！\n……不，关于那件事，实在是非常失礼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2008_p", "source_sha256": "773eb0cfd0c60a188b780307efab3ba06ed15d2eb1d2e017389bddb6efd1c208", "ja": "いいよ、実際いろいろフォローしてもらったし。\nこれからも、してもらうつもりだから。", "zh": "没关系，毕竟你也帮我处理了不少事情。\n今后也打算继续请你帮忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2009_009rit", "source_sha256": "f8d50b70cd27d3f2d20bb8dd2cb49e1a187b5adea7412542bfb1f5eb519cb946", "ja": "あら正直。ま、そういうことなら……いいのかしら？\n……うん、いいことにしましょう！", "zh": "哎呀，真诚实。既然这样……应该没问题吧？\n……嗯，就当没问题吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2010_009rit", "source_sha256": "a2f33ac52b45e6bb2b71b305de3b65e0a257be23468894d332be6df1afb5f3bf", "ja": "それじゃ、これからも二人三脚ということで。\n残ってる書類、ささっと片付けちゃいますか。", "zh": "那么，今后也继续同心协力吧。\n剩下的文件，我们赶紧处理完吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2011_p", "source_sha256": "9b20420cdb4a70fdc631cf62e46d0f91f49a58719b8cb348c960c8eb8ec505b5", "ja": "わかった。何をすればいい？", "zh": "明白了。需要我做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2012_009rit", "source_sha256": "3e9a4a8fc50b68a15bc2a7961d48701a02f22475c43a772e0c12fed3b9c46afe", "ja": "そこにプリントアウトしてある書類、\nつき合わせてもらえますか？　性能を比較したくて。", "zh": "可以帮我把打印出来的资料拿来对照一下吗？我想比较一下性能。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2013_p", "source_sha256": "75b94892084415cdff64bd488b97fd1da2b58449fb86f8bf991a39c795fe39da", "ja": "わかった。……多いな？", "zh": "知道了。……还真不少啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2014_009rit", "source_sha256": "ac1833f3c6ccb93338b8587b22f064964d85e6fa059655f9f1b11cc8967c2a58", "ja": "前から気になってた機材があるんですけど、今回、\n試してみようかなーって。いくつかあるんですけどね。", "zh": "有件一直很在意的器材，这次想试试看。虽然有好几个就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2015_p", "source_sha256": "705ba3397d089edae6005697f875e7f9bc609a0c64eb5c99d01e0348556a6493", "ja": "なるほど。さすがの情報収集能力だな……。\n助かるよ。", "zh": "原来如此。不愧是你，搜集信息的能力果然厉害啊……帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2016_009rit", "source_sha256": "c486e0b4e932a4470244151c91b6926e4300deb1f0a361d046a45aec27908ab1", "ja": "こういうのは得意な人間がやればいいんです。\n……二人三脚で、最高のステージを作りましょうね！", "zh": "这种事就交给擅长的人来做吧。\n……让我们同心协力，打造出最棒的舞台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_009rit_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_009rit_2017_p", "source_sha256": "6c51520aade0abca44b307cea001a4a461dc344b4dfd0ea58caeabf28f8b1b51", "ja": "ああ。今度の公演も、その次も……。\nこれからもよろしくな！", "zh": "啊。下次的公演，还有再下一次……以后也请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
